[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m QNaN-indefinite `0xFFC00000` rather than propagating an input payload).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **D. Geometric shapes the predicates distinguish.** overlapping; exactly touching
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (`d2 == r2`, where the `<` is strictly false — the boundary case); separated;
